# NOTICE.md pins a SHA-256 for every file in this directory, and those hashes
# are the only thing tying the vendored artifacts to their upstream releases.
# The repository root sets `* text=auto`, which would rewrite the engine's line
# endings on a Windows checkout and make its documented hash fail to verify
# there. Vendored bytes are vendored bytes: keep them exactly as upstream
# shipped them.
*                     -text
*.js                  -text -diff linguist-vendored
*.gz    binary
COPYING               -text linguist-vendored
COPYING.txt           -text linguist-vendored
